#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:1
msgid "HM-G51B 快速开始"
msgstr "HM-G51B Getting Started"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:6
msgid ""
"完成 **HM-G51B** 的供电、UART 连接和首次独立 GNSS 定位验证。接收机模组支持 "
"L1 频段信号处理，通过 UART 输出 UBX-NAV-PVT，默认波特率为 `115200`。"
msgstr ""
"Power the **HM-G51B**, connect its UART, and verify the first standalone "
"GNSS position. The receiver module processes L1-band signals and outputs UBX-"
"NAV-PVT over UART at a default baud rate of `115200`."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:10
msgid ""
"产品边界 G51B 提供独立 GNSS 定位，不需要 CORS/NTRIP 或 D13 基站。需要厘米级定"
"位时，应选择 D20 或 D13 系列。完整参数见[产品对比与资料](../../products/"
"comparison.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Product scope: G51B provides standalone GNSS positioning without CORS/NTRIP "
"or a D13 base station. Choose the D20 or D13 series for centimeter-level "
"positioning. See [Product Comparison and Resources](../../products/"
"comparison.md) for complete specifications."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:13
msgid "准备设备"
msgstr "Prepare equipment"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:15
msgid "G51B 接收机模组。"
msgstr "G51B receiver module."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:16
msgid "4.0–5.5 V 电源，典型 5 V。"
msgstr "4.0–5.5 V power supply, typically 5 V."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:17
msgid "与 G51B 接口电平兼容的 USB 转 UART 模块，或目标设备 UART 串口。"
msgstr ""
"USB to UART module compatible with G51B interface levels, or the target "
"device's UART serial port."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid "PC 端 {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>` 上位机。"
msgstr "PC-side {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>` host PC."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:19
msgid "能够保证天空视野的安装位置。"
msgstr "An installation position that can ensure a clear view of the sky."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:21
msgid "连接供电和串口"
msgstr "Connect power and serial port"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:23
msgid ""
"HM-G51B 使用 6-pin MX1.25 mm 接口，提供电源、UART 和磁力计 I2C 信号，不提供 "
"PPS 引脚。按随产品提供的接口资料完成连接："
msgstr ""
"HM-G51B uses a 6-pin MX1.25 mm interface for power, UART, and magnetometer "
"I2C signals. It has no PPS pin. Follow the supplied interface documentation:"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:25
msgid "供电范围为 4.0–5.5 V，典型 5 V；上电前确认电压和极性。"
msgstr ""
"Supply 4.0–5.5 V (5 V typical); verify voltage and polarity before power-on."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:26
msgid "UART TX/RX 交叉连接，并与 USB 转 UART 模块或目标设备共地。"
msgstr ""
"Cross TX/RX and connect ground to the USB-to-UART module or target device."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:27
msgid "UART I/O 电平以交付版本的接口资料为准。"
msgstr ""
"Use the UART I/O level specified in the supplied interface documentation."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:29
msgid "安装位置"
msgstr "Installation location"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:31
msgid ""
"G51B 需要接收 GNSS 卫星信号。安装时应尽量保证天线朝向天空，避开金属遮挡、高"
"楼、树木和强电磁干扰区域。"
msgstr ""
"The G51B needs to receive GNSS satellite signals. During installation, the "
"antenna should be oriented towards the sky as much as possible, avoiding "
"metal obstructions, tall buildings, trees, and areas with strong "
"electromagnetic interference."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:33
msgid ""
"在无人机、车载或资产定位终端中使用时，应优先将天线布置在设备上方或外壳开阔位"
"置，避免被电池、金属结构件或大功率无线模块遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"When used in drones, vehicle-mounted, or asset positioning terminals, the "
"antenna should preferably be placed on top of the device or in an open part "
"of the casing, avoiding obstruction by batteries, metal structural parts, or "
"high-power wireless modules."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:35
msgid "连接上位机"
msgstr "Connect to the host PC"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:37
#, python-brace-format
msgid "下载并打开 {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>`。"
msgstr "Download and open {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>`."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:38
msgid "选择 G51B 对应的串口号。"
msgstr "Select the serial port number corresponding to G51B."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:39
msgid "波特率选择 `115200`。"
msgstr "Set the baud rate to `115200`."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:40
msgid "点击连接。"
msgstr "Click the link."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:41
msgid "查看卫星数、经纬高、定位状态和 UBX-NAV-PVT 数据输出。"
msgstr ""
"Check the number of satellites, latitude and longitude height, positioning "
"status, and UBX-NAV-PVT data output."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:43
msgid "验证定位输出"
msgstr "Verify positioning output"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:45
msgid "首次定位"
msgstr "First positioning"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:47
msgid ""
"G51B 热启动时间约 1 秒，冷启动时间约 28 秒。首次上电或长时间断电后，定位时间"
"可能受天空视野、卫星环境和安装位置影响。"
msgstr ""
"G51B hot-start TTFF is approximately 1 second, and cold-start TTFF is "
"approximately 28 seconds. After the first power-on or an extended power-off, positioning "
"time may be affected by sky view, satellite environment, and installation "
"location."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:49
msgid "输出检查"
msgstr "Output Check"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:51
msgid ""
"正常工作时，上位机或目标设备中应持续接收到定位数据。若无法获得稳定定位，应优"
"先检查以下项目："
msgstr ""
"During normal operation, the host PC or target device should continuously "
"receive positioning data. If stable positioning cannot be obtained, the "
"following items should be checked first:"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:53
msgid "供电电压是否稳定。"
msgstr "Verify that the supply voltage is stable."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:54
msgid "TX/RX 是否交叉连接。"
msgstr "Verify that TX and RX are crossed."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:55
msgid "串口波特率是否为 `115200`。"
msgstr "Is the serial port baud rate `115200`?"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:56
msgid "天线位置是否开阔。"
msgstr "Is the antenna location open?"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:57
msgid "设备附近是否存在明显遮挡或强干扰。"
msgstr "Check for significant obstructions or interference near the device."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:59
msgid "首次使用完成判据"
msgstr "Getting Started success criteria"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:62
msgid ""
"上位机或目标设备持续接收到 UBX-NAV-PVT 定位数据，经纬度、高程和定位状态正常更"
"新。"
msgstr ""
"The host PC or target device continuously receives UBX-NAV-PVT positioning "
"data, with latitude, longitude, altitude, and positioning status updating "
"normally."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:65
msgid "配置管理"
msgstr "Configuration Management"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:67
msgid ""
"需要修改输出频率或消息项时，先确认 UBX-NAV-PVT 输出要求，再使用配套工具配置；"
"PVT 最高更新率为 20 Hz。"
msgstr ""
"Before changing the update rate or message set, confirm the UBX-NAV-PVT "
"requirements and use the supplied tool. The maximum PVT update rate is 20 Hz."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:69
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:71
msgid ""
"需要查看产品定位和选型信息，可进入 [HM-G51B 产品页](../../products/models/hm-"
"g51b.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To view product positioning and model selection information, you can go to "
"the [HM-G51B Product Page](../../products/models/hm-g51b.md)."

#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/getting-started.md:72
#, python-brace-format
msgid "需要调试或配置接收机参数，可使用 {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>`。"
msgstr ""
"Use {ref}`NavStarTool <software-tools>` to inspect or configure receiver "
"parameters."

